Method Accuracy Stability Use Case Forward Euler Low Poor Testing Backward Euler Low Good Stiff systems Trapezoidal Medium Good General purpose <pre><code>// Trapezoidal integration (best general purpose)
public double calculate(double[] inputs, double time) {
    double dt = getTimeStep();
    double input = inputs[0];

    // Trapezoidal rule
    state += 0.5 * dt * (input + previousInput);
    previousInput = input;

    return state;
}
</code></pre>

